{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/4d8f4f0643429c55528d37c30ef977e6.avif?t=1774343803\" alt=\"Game Settings (Title)\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/931632266e09eef4b2c85b2af0b3505d.poster.avif?t=1774343803\" width=404 height=44 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/931632266e09eef4b2c85b2af0b3505d.webm?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/931632266e09eef4b2c85b2af0b3505d.mp4?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Alex, a journalist for a tech website, stuck in a monotonous endless routine. Until one day everything changes: a mysterious package appears at your door. Inside: a custom console and a game cartridge. No label. No instructions. Just a gaming experience that feels unfinished... or deliberately incomplete. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/b031d669109b2155ea03e841469c02ae.poster.avif?t=1774343803\" aria-label=\"Insert the cartridge and play!\" width=964 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/b031d669109b2155ea03e841469c02ae.webm?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/b031d669109b2155ea03e841469c02ae.mp4?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/2fb5ea4c113ed0846fe4391922d1366e.poster.avif?t=1774343803\" width=252 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/2fb5ea4c113ed0846fe4391922d1366e.webm?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/2fb5ea4c113ed0846fe4391922d1366e.mp4?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no combat. No score. No objectives. Only exploration, enigmatic conversations, and a menu full of cryptic settings you\u2019re meant to adjust. <br>Each area you explore reacts to the changes you make in the console settings. But what do these parameters really control? And who designed this game in the first place? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/6abbbbf7ed5c160505613a138df21d12.poster.avif?t=1774343803\" aria-label=\"The settings menu\" width=964 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/6abbbbf7ed5c160505613a138df21d12.webm?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/6abbbbf7ed5c160505613a138df21d12.mp4?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/ec7ff0b9994f6d25c08d5bed89f8f895.poster.avif?t=1774343803\" width=504 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/ec7ff0b9994f6d25c08d5bed89f8f895.webm?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/ec7ff0b9994f6d25c08d5bed89f8f895.mp4?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as curiosity slowly unravels into something a lot deeper. An abandoned system, a forgotten experiment, and surely a message left behind\u2026 or perhaps still to be written.<br>Uncover the history of the console and its mysterious creators. What was this system meant to do\u2026 and why was it abandoned?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/d88e7ae430ea18f88eb1a9ce421f4206.poster.avif?t=1774343803\" aria-label=\"An everyday travel to work in the metro\" width=780 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/extras/d88e7ae430ea18f88eb1a9ce421f4206.webm?t=1774343803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907260?t=1774343803","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/847742e13f52e0be924d73ee7f19a1729ab20b68/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774343803","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/f2bd701aadfb297ff035392be7f1b5abda2b190c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774343803","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907260/f2bd701aadfb297ff035392be7f1b5abda2